  "source": "// Valve trim ladder. eqpct at u=1 collapses to the fixed law (d=0); at u=0.5\n// with rangeability R=50 the effective Cv is Cv/sqrt(50), so the flow ratio to\n// the u=1 valve is 1/sqrt(50) = 0.1414214.\n// EXPECT d_full = 0 tol 1e-9\n// EXPECT r_half = 0.1414214 tol 1e-6\nSource SR1(fluid$=Water, mdot=mfree1, P=300000, T=300)\nValve  V1(model$=eqpct, Cv=1e-5, rho=997, u=1, R=50)\nSink   SK1()\nconnect(SR1.out, V1.in)\nconnect(V1.out, SK1.in)\nV1.out.P = 100000\nSource SR2(fluid$=Water, mdot=mfree2, P=300000, T=300)\nValve  V2(model$=fixed, Cv=1e-5, rho=997)\nSink   SK2()\nconnect(SR2.out, V2.in)\nconnect(V2.out, SK2.in)\nV2.out.P = 100000\nSource SR3(fluid$=Water, mdot=mfree3, P=300000, T=300)\nValve  V3(model$=eqpct, Cv=1e-5, rho=997, u=0.5, R=50)\nSink   SK3()\nconnect(SR3.out, V3.in)\nconnect(V3.out, SK3.in)\nV3.out.P = 100000\nd_full = V1.in.mdot - V2.in.mdot\nr_half = V3.in.mdot / V1.in.mdot\n",
